                "message": "Mirror libraries/modules/ in docs/tangles/\n\nEach module doc now lives in the subdirectory of docs/tangles/ that\nmatches its module's directory in libraries/modules/ (base/navi/,\ncustom/, ui/ and so on), together with its -old.org predecessor.\nTangle paths and README links gain the extra ../, relative links to\nthe older notes are adjusted, and the module tree and README tangle-all\nblock follow the new layout. Notes with no module of their own stay at\nthe top of docs/tangles/. Tangling all 131 docs gives the same .el\nfiles as before.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013V6WSXthgpc9jPWyZsevsf",
